      "writtenOn": "2020-10-13T23:26:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This code is only used for the case pd_disabled_on_init is 1. The pd_disabled_on_init was assigned to 1 only if CONFIG_SYSTEM_UNLOCKED is defined and CONFIG_VBOOT_EFS2 is not defined, i.e. the line 623.\n\nIn alternative, we can move the if clause inside the function, like:\n\n    if (IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_SYSTEM_UNLOCKED) \u0026\u0026 !IS_ENABLED(CONFIG_VBOOT_EFS2)) {\n        if (pd_disabled_on_init \u0026\u0026 ...\n\n    }\n\nRemoving the if clause (outside or inside) also works. I can make it if you prefer.",
